"Fedora IoT is created by a team in the Fedora community called the IoT "
"Working Group. It is comprised of official members who have decision making "
"powers, as well as other contributors. Learn more on the IoT Working Group "
"website."
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[4]-%3Econtent-%3Etext
msgid ""
"Fedora Workstation is created by a teamm in the Fedora community called the "
"**Workstation Working Group**. It is comprised of official members who have "
"decision making powers, as well as other contributors. [Learn more onthe "
"Workstation Working Group Website.](https://docs.fedoraproject.org/en-US/"
"workstation-working-group/)"
